OL,3,GNEWSALevel crossing closed after
OL,4,Achildren play chicken
OL,5,
OL,6,FA level crossing in east London has
OL,7,Fbeen closed after children and
OL,8,Fteenagers were filmed playing "chicken"
OL,9,Fwith oncoming trains.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail said the footage at
OL,12,FHavering's Brickfields crossing, near
OL,13,FUpminster, was captured during a survey
OL,14,Fof how the crossing was being used.
OL,16,FIt showed young people doing
OL,17,Fhandstands, racing across to beat
OL,18,Ftrains, walking on the anti-trespass
OL,19,Fboards and using their phones while
OL,20,Fcrossing. About 230 trains use the line
OL,21,Fevery day.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
