OL,3,GNEWSALevel crossing closed after
OL,4,Achildren play chicken
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe crossing was shut for an initial
OL,7,F21-day period on 30 September, but
OL,8,FNetwork Rail said the closure would be
OL,9,Fextended.
